egory_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"K8O71Tb6xcza0g1MU608ag","review_id":"JuXOQeuvD0INoigg5qhF9Q","date":"2012-12-20T05:51:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9466961622238159,"text_excerpt":"My Louisiana Food Hounds are truly blessed... not only are they in one of the most incredible places in America for fantasmic foodie bliss; but you also have Jagerhaus right in your backyard! For those of you who are NOT in the know, this place one of the top German restaurants on Conti who rocks Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner like it's going out of style! An interesting tidbit of info is that the owners of the establishment are all from the Czech Republic; so you'll find a lot of Czech & Hungarian influence in the cuisine. As their style of cooking is heavier (with the use of cheeses, etc.), the meals are heartier which intensifies yummification! Since Etan Wish and I made our visit around ..."},{"business_id":"K8O71Tb6xcza0g1MU608ag","review_id":"-pJSY7iUAfBxx6tZdE6s9Q","date":"2014-01-03T05:51:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9385786652565002,"text_excerpt":"Excellent meal and German food! I got the Jaegerschnitzel, which had the best creamy, mushroom sauce that I ever had! I would make a drink out of it because it was so delectable. The bed of spaetzle was wonderful as well. My table received a complementary shot of warmed, fruit-flavored wine, which was perfect for the chilly evening in the French Quarter. The waitress was both friendly and helpful. The only downside I could come up with is the back of the restaurant, where the waitress and other staff were organizing dishes and utensils. It became noisy and disrupted the ambience of the charming set-up of the restaurant. Other than that, great place!"},{"business_id":"K8O71Tb6xcza0g1MU608ag","review_id":"3C4zDGS4Qg1yYGEpzB4TLw","date":"2013-01-02T02:15:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9384557008743286,"text_excerpt":"This place was awesome. We were in NOLA for NYE and hadn't made reservations, and everything was booked. I remembered I had bookmarked this place on yelp, thought people wouldn't probably be eating German on NYE, and headed over. The first thing I noticed when I walked in that it was a lot smaller than I thought it would be. We were seated promptly. I glanced over the menu and i thought it seemed to have a good selection and reasonable prices. We ended up ordering the cheese plate for an appetizer, I ordered the pork shank, my friend ordered the oktoberfest plate, and my other friend just ordered a beer. The beer list here was, as to be expected, mostly concentrated on German styles. I or..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"K8O71Tb6xcza0g1MU608ag","photo_id":"zfVk3NGlRol7nznGNVrTcw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zfVk3NGlRol7nznGNVrTcw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8460599184036255},{"business_id":"K8O71Tb6xcza0g1MU608ag","photo_id":"vvTLdobC7CIXj9Fc4Pr_gA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/vvTLdobC7CIXj9Fc4Pr_gA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8101747035980225},{"business_id":"K8O71Tb6xcza0g1MU608ag","photo_id":"4kay3t_YM6TvCE9szYk9nw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/4kay3t_YM6TvCE9szYk9nw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.805691123008728},{"business_id":"K8O71Tb6xcza0g1MU608ag","photo_id